{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M19\",\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"why\": \"它把身体紧张归因于尚未弄清自己有多在意的靠近冲动，而B2恰恰强调自己已经很清楚想说什么、也明白说出口的后果，B1和B3也没有这种人际动机。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M21\",\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"why\": \"它把等待归因于后来才意识到自己在等一个心意未知的人，而B2强调的是自己早已清楚意图和话语后果，B1和B3也没有以他人心意的不确定为原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M23\",\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"它说明身体为何会在意识尚未想到具体对象时就产生紧张和意外兴奋，能够解释B1开头烟花般突发、带有兴奋色彩的冲击感，而不只是重复其突然性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M25\",\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"没有前序经验可依靠，使身体只能对尚无落点的期待作出反应，这解释了B3为何像刚踏上船板、身体尚未安稳地交给规律摇荡，而不是已经进入稳定的船歌节奏。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M26\",\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"why\": \"它解释的是悬置感持续而未构成威胁后，为何会转为愿意停留的吸引，但B1和B3只描述尚未落稳或尚未进入规律摇荡，B2的谨慎也并非由这种无害的悬置感引起。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M28\",\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"兴奋已经发生却没有带来踏实，因此转成屏息等待，这解释了B1为何在烟花般的爆发与声响消退之后仍悬在水面上方、没有真正落稳。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M30\",\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\",\n        \"S01-B3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"未有准备时，身体先察觉到不能忽略的刺激，解释了B1开头和弦的猝然感，也解释了B3刚踏上船板时身体先受到冲击、尚未适应摇荡的起步感。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M31\",\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"S01-B1\",\n        \"S01-B3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"先前的冲击已经过去却没有新的内容接续，使感受停留在未确定的等待中，这解释了B1声响落下仍未落稳，以及B3所听到的规律船歌摇荡尚未建立。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"M33\",\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"why\": \"它把紧张转为期待归因于身体先察觉对方的重要、随后才意识到亲近的可能，而B2的谨慎来自早已知道自己想说什么及说出口会改变关系，两者的因果顺序和关键动机并不相同。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d28e1ee2-8d5f-4aec-8f79-f5b6b98941d9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T015321118225Z", "elapsed_seconds": 325.609, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T01:58:46.722911+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "705dc289e0305570abc77a886c217a776b34b71d7847ae34dfd649b07889b1da", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T015321118225Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5f4fe651030b5a21edce299a573bab257e4e7ffa778225fec4ec2accfb98a9cd"}}}
